      "leadSummary": "Statistical experiment spaces, Borel sample spaces, and probability measures; Parametric families of distributions and parameter spaces; Model identifiability and algebraic proofs of non-identifiable mixtures; The Likelihood Principle, profile likelihood, and score function algebra; Fisher Information regularity conditions and Cramér-Rao regularity assumptions.",
